{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50654","headline":"忆钱塘 · 李廓","name":"忆钱塘","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"往岁东游鬓未凋，渡江曾驻木兰桡。\n一千里色中秋月，十万军声半夜潮。\n桂倚玉儿吟处雪，蓬遗苏丞舞时腰。\n仍闻江上春来柳，依旧参差拂寺桥。\n（见韦庄《又玄集》卷中。\n）（〖1〗陶敏云。\n此诗之颈联「一千里色中秋月，十万军声半夜潮。」\n张爲《诗人主客图》取爲赵嘏句，《全唐诗》卷五五○亦收赵嘏句。）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李廓","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50654.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50654","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}